WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.378 --> 00:00:09.092
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> He’s beautiful. Is he a Shih Tzu? Sorry, he or she?

2
00:00:09.134 --> 00:00:14.407
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> She. Yes, she’s a Shih Tzu. Her name’s Dolly. And your dog?

3
00:00:14.561 --> 00:00:15.736
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> He’s a Labrador.

4
00:00:16.044 --> 00:00:17.107
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> What’s his name?

5
00:00:17.317 --> 00:00:20.716
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> Barry. Barry, come here!

6
00:00:20.828 --> 00:00:23.066
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> Dolly. Here. Stop it.

7
00:00:23.206 --> 00:00:24.506
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> I think Barry likes her.

8
00:00:24.968 --> 00:00:28.605
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> Yes! Sorry, I’m Dave. What’s your name?

9
00:00:28.661 --> 00:00:30.018
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> Becca. Hi.

10
00:00:30.164 --> 00:00:32.899
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> Nice to meet you, Becca! How old is Barry?

11
00:00:33.444 --> 00:00:38.606
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> Er… He’s, er, two. And Dolly?

12
00:00:38.746 --> 00:00:43.502
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> Er… The same. Hey, Dolly! Come back!